0 -16 Td
(Every approved technical institution must obtain an annual Extension of Approval \(EoA\) prior to) Tj
0 -16 Td
(commencing admissions for the academic year. The grant of EoA is strictly contingent upon full) Tj
0 -16 Td
(compliance with council norms regarding land, built-up area, faculty cadre ratio, and certificates.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
